// A bare name in type position that names no alias and no type parameter,
// in each place a type hint can be written.
//
// The error carried no span, so it rendered nothing and was dropped whenever
// any other diagnostic was present -- which a failed binding always produces,
// since it leaves the name it was binding undefined.

